Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 16:46:09 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] fix(post): refuse unsupported G73 and G85 dwell

Refuse positive dwell before cycle output in the LinuxCNC, Tormach,
and grblHAL posts. Pin named refusals and zero-dwell output.

Co-Authored-By: OpenAI Codex <codex@openai.com>

Fixes #2609
